WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.833
Sara walked near a stream.

2
00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:16.233
"The sun is so hot!" she said.

3
00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:21.247
Sara saw wide leaves.

4
00:00:21.248 --> 00:00:28.410
She had an idea.

5
00:00:28.411 --> 00:00:36.292
Sara tied the leaves with vines.

6
00:00:36.293 --> 00:00:40.537
Soon she had a big hat!

7
00:00:40.538 --> 00:00:44.998
"That's a big hat, Sara!" Tor said.

8
00:00:44.999 --> 00:00:48.669
"It blocks the bright sun," Sara said.

9
00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:52.033
"Good idea," Rex said.

10
00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:57.541
Sid nodded. "I want a big hat too."

11
00:00:57.542 --> 00:01:02.266
"You can make hats," Sara said.

12
00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.831
She looked around.

13
00:01:04.832 --> 00:01:07.925
"Uh-oh," Sara said.

14
00:01:07.926 --> 00:01:16.485
"I used all the leaves."

15
00:01:16.486 --> 00:01:21.528
"Over there!" Rex pointed.

16
00:01:21.529 --> 00:01:28.753
More leaves were across the stream.

17
00:01:28.754 --> 00:01:38.527
"How can we get there?" Sid asked.

18
00:01:38.528 --> 00:01:41.578
Tor saw logs.

19
00:01:41.579 --> 00:01:47.128
"Let's build a bridge," she said.

20
00:01:47.129 --> 00:02:00.644
The buddies got to work.

21
00:02:00.645 --> 00:02:09.941
Sara put down her hat.

22
00:02:09.942 --> 00:02:14.189
A toad saw the hat.

23
00:02:14.190 --> 00:02:20.738
The toad smiled. "A house!"

